<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">AI + DEEP SARSA</view><view class="h1">智能决策</view><view class="muted">LLM 负责理解问题和解释，最终营销动作由 Deep SARSA 选择。</view><view class="card"><view class="h2">经营问题</view><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="1600" placeholder="例如：最近抖音获客成本持续升高，同时库存压力较大，下一步预算应该怎么调整？" bindinput="onQuestion"></textarea><view class="field-title">经营目标</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{profiles}}" range-key="label" value="{{profileIndex}}" bindchange="onProfile"><view class="picker">{{profiles[profileIndex].label}} ›</view></picker><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}">生成营销动作</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card result"><view class="eyebrow">SARSA ACTION</view><view class="action">{{result.action_label}}</view><view class="muted">模型版本：{{result.model_version}}</view><view class="muted">Q 值：{{result.q_selected}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="muted">该建议已写入决策记录。实际执行动作和结果反馈仍需人工确认，系统不会自动伪造执行结果。</view></view></view>